    "text": "Our Liability Practice Group has offices in both Virginia and the Washington, DC area, and we handle all aspects of a premises liability claim from initial investigation through appeal. We represent our clients in all state and federal trial and appellate courts, as well as in administrative and alternative dispute resolution proceedings."
